# Network Design

## VPC Configuration

A dedicated Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) was created to isolate infrastructure.

## Subnet Design

- Public Subnets
  - Application Load Balancer
  - NAT Gateway

- Private Application Subnets
  - EC2 Application Servers

- Private Database Subnets
  - Aurora Primary and Replica

## Internet Connectivity

- Internet Gateway attached to VPC
- NAT Gateway enables outbound internet access for private instances

## Routing Strategy

- Public Route Table → Routes to Internet Gateway
- Private Route Table → Routes to NAT Gateway
- Database Subnet Route Table → No direct internet access
